          "exact_statement": "A formal coefficient record is a sequence $(c_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$ of specified coefficients. Unless convergence and an evaluation map are separately proved and adopted, the symbol records coefficients only: it is not an evaluated function, exact probability, convergent perturbation series, or error bound.",
