          "exact_statement": "The cross-section coefficient map is $(\\hbar c)^2\\overline{|\\mathcal A|^2}d\\Phi_2/(F S_f)$; the decay map is $(2\\hbar\\mathsf M_0S_f)^{-1}\\int|\\mathcal G|^2d\\Phi_2$.",
