        {
          "supplier": "post-qft-formal-qed-coefficients",
          "carrier": "items/post-qft-formal-qed-coefficients.md",
          "status": "Current batch-53 QFT-G02 postulate draft registered and inspected. It has no Proof section; its exact direct interface is present, while the transitive Dirac-matrix supplier has escalated readiness.",
          "source_section": "Postulate",
          "exact_statement": "For mu>0 and off-shell p with h(p,p)-mu^2 nonzero, use fermion-line coefficient i(not p+mu)/(h(p,p)-mu^2). The Feynman-gauge photon-line coefficient is D^F_ab(k)=-i h_ab/(h(k,k)+i0).",
