          "status": "Current assigned A-page postulate; QFT-G02 carrier is missing.",
          "source_section": "Postulate",
          "exact_statement": "Assume Countable Choice. The two-body coefficient map and named formal tree amplitudes are adopted only as model-specific leading perturbative readings; no exact continuum observable or empirical estimate is asserted.",
